\fs24 \cf0 Product Name:
\f1\b0  Unifying Theory Engine (UTE)\uc0\u8232 
\f0\b Product Type:
\f1\b0  Interactive reasoning system (LLM-driven, UI-mediated)\uc0\u8232 
\f0\b Core Purpose:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 UTE is a structured reasoning engine that enables users to construct, test, and refine a 
\f2\i single unifying theory
\f1\i0  across multiple leveraged domains (e.g., physics, cognition, language, AI, systems design, economics) using a fixed canonical reference.\
UTE does 
\f0\b not
\f1\b0  aim to discover new facts autonomously. Its purpose is to 
\f0\b preserve identity across domains
\f1\b0 , surface structural equivalence, and prevent semantic drift while allowing lawful novelty. The product treats theories as 
\f2\i motions within constraint
\f1\i0 , not narratives or beliefs.\

